## What is this?
This is a weekly sales analysis for five consecutive weeks.
## Why does it exist?
This analysis will help determine why some week are lower while others are higher, this will help marketing to better structure their campaign.
## How do I run it (or read it)?
From the analysis( results), one must look how the numbers tell a particular story about the sales that occured during those weeks. 
## What is in here?
Python, conda, pandas, and other libraries  are used to support this analysis.